          "file": "RiderPool.claimFor",
          "body": "/**\n * The ranking is only a snapshot: another order may take the top rider a\n * microsecond later. So we walk the ranking and keep trying to claim until\n * one compare-and-set succeeds.\n */\npublic Optional<Rider> claimFor(Location pickup) {\n    for (Rider candidate : strategy.rank(pickup, riders)) {\n        if (candidate.tryClaim()) return Optional.of(candidate);\n    }\n    return Optional.empty();\n}"
